## Failure Patterns to Avoid

### ❌ Ad-Hoc Pattern (OLD WAY)
```
User: "Migrate GenAI"
Agent: *grep for files*
Agent: *work on what I find*
Agent: "Done! Everything migrated!"
User: "What's left?"
Agent: *grep again* "Oh, 9 more files..."
```

### ✅ Brain-First Pattern (NEW WAY)
```
User: "Migrate GenAI"
Agent: *call brain_session_start()*
Agent: "Brain shows Priority 1: Deploy Landing Page from yesterday"
Agent: "Also shows 9 pending GenAI tasks"
Agent: "Should I work on Priority 1 first, or proceed with GenAI as you requested?"
User: "Do GenAI"
Agent: *work on GenAI*
Agent: *update_task as each completes*
Agent: "Completed 4/9 GenAI tasks. 5 remain (providers/)."
```

