## Enforcement

### System-Level
- Tool [brain_session_start()](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#3976-4110) added to codebase
- This protocol document in Brain artifacts
- [brain_get_state()](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2449-2453) updated to warn if no active session

### Agent-Level (YOU)
- Read this document at start of significant work sessions
- Follow the protocol or risk repeating the "victory conquest" failure
- When in doubt, query Brain first

